# Stats tab (#): session cost and agent time from the fixture event log seed.sh writes.
Output "/out/tui-stats.mp4"
Require mugicrew
Source /kit/settings.tape
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/demo && export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Show
Type "mugicrew" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "#" Sleep 4s
Type "b" Sleep 3s
Type "b" Sleep 3s
Type "w" Sleep 3s
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
